.el .ds Aq '
.TH ontology 1  "ontology " 
.SH NAME
ontology \- Discover active ontology element types, relationship types, and endpoint capabilities
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBontology\fR [\fB\-\-compact\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Discover active ontology element types, relationship types, and endpoint capabilities
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-compact\fR
Display compact shortened type IDs without human\-readable names
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ontology\-show(1)
Inspect detailed capabilities and endpoint admissibility for a type
.TP
ontology\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
